```
		red_pwm_led: red_pwm_led {
			pwms = <&pwm1 2 4 PWM_POLARITY_NORMAL>;
		};
```

In case of output N the LL_TIM_OC_StructInit must init the pwm with 
		oc_init.OC**N**State = LL_TIM_OCSTATE_ENABLE;
		oc_init.OCState = LL_TIM_OCSTATE_DISABLE;

